<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Fosters net up 2.0 pct to A$293 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Fosters net up 2.0 pct to A$293 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    302.2 vs 367.3</p>
<p>    Net				     293.3 vs 287.3</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		   loss 1.7 vs loss 92.20</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		6.0 vs 5.84</p>
<p>NOTE: Fosters Brewing Group Ltd is about 37.6 percent owned by The Broken Hill Proprietary Co. Previous year figures include Courage Brewing investment, since sold.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     11.0  vs   10.42</p>
<p>    Sales (billion)			 2.25 vs    4.37</p>
<p>    Other income			  184.8  vs  494.1</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    15.0  vs   14.7</p>
<p>    Abnormal			   loss 1.7  vs  loss 92.2</p>
<p>Dividend is unfranked</p>
<p>Pay date Oct 4</p>
<p>Reg date Sept 20</p>
<p>    Tax			     credit 8.5  vs  credit 21.5</p>
<p>    Interest			     101.0  vs 180.6</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  58.7  vs 158.7</p>
<p>NOTE: Operating profit before abnormal items and tax by division:</p>
<p>Brewing</p>
<p>    Carlton United Breweries	 326.6  vs 282.1</p>
<p>    Molson Companies		    61.4  vs  71.9</p>
